WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.047
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: What should come first in

00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:06.259
writing about “My School”?

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:10.914
The answer is: List ideas to include. Plan before drafting.

00:00:11.783 --> 00:00:16.935
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which plan best organises

00:00:16.935 --> 00:00:18.653
a paragraph about a market?

00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:24.761
The answer is: Where it is, what people sell, why it matters. Group related ideas in

00:00:24.761 --> 00:00:25.741
a useful order.
